 //=> 1
 ```
 
+#### debouncedFunction.clearQueue(reason?)
+
+Type: `(reason?: unknown) => number`
+
+With `after: true`, discard the queued latest-arguments invocation and reject all promises waiting for it. The return value is the number of waiting calls discarded. If `reason` is omitted or `undefined`, the promises reject with an error whose name is `AbortError`. The currently executing invocation is not affected. With the default `after: false`, this method returns `0`.
+
 #### function_
 
 Type: `Function`
